{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The expansion pack 2 of 'Esports Godfather' brings 5 new heroes with different styles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >#No need to restart the game; heroes can directly join the player's hero pool through training.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\u00b7Leon</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gladiator/Physical/Melee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065190/extras/3e0c1cfbf81871137cc89245a78d8cd8.avif?t=1759903706\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The slender specter Leon is obsessed with driving his enemies into madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In battle, Leon marks his enemies in various ways with eternal brands. Targets afflicted by his torment will descend into madness, attacking their own allies. When an enemy reaches their limit and is on the verge of collapse, Leon personally delivers a painful release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065190/extras/391c2916d406b7711042f82225ac0e62.avif?t=1759903706\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\u00b7Felicity</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support/Magic/Melee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065190/extras/5a7594dedb6090f788889745cd5473d5.avif?t=1759903706\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The harbinger of happiness, Felicity's mission is to bring 'happiness' to everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In combat, Felicity envelops her enemies in happiness with gentle yet irresistible force. Any attempt to resist this gift will incur her punishment\u2014she will drown their will in an overwhelming flood of happiness until they willingly succumb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065190/extras/28e8f15aeda741f515bf64b72bb33745.avif?t=1759903706\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\u00b7Fernan</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gladiator/Magic/Melee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065190/extras/a09d2bc98a62f3358555c2a2575bd658.avif?t=1759903706\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The memory thief Fernan delights in stealing others' most precious memories, adding them to his unique collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy who fights Fernan is shocked by his vast magical reserves. No one knows what magic Fernan specializes in, making it impossible to defend against.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;When your opponent casually casts the spell you've spent your life mastering and take pride in, anyone would despair.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065190/extras/07b5966075224c1527ec7ccf019353da.avif?t=1759903706\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\u00b7Chen Fengcheng</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warrior/Physical/Melee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065190/extras/6b09458707daea58a0ff7f11127ceedd.avif?t=1759903706\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After years of relentless battles, the pirate lord Chen Fengcheng became the sole ruler of the kingdom's seas. He is renowned for his fair rewards and punishments when dividing spoils among his crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Everyone gets a share! Rewards are given regardless of merit or fault!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every crew member who receives a reward sings his praises, but those secretly eliminated before the division might disagree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065190/extras/cdb6616ca73434992d0b14b3d9d53182.avif?t=1759903706\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\u00b7Anna</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support/Magic/Ranged</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065190/extras/4a31be5715cba4130519a4ae9de03c4a.avif?t=1759903706\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a wealthy young lady who rarely leaves her chambers, the horticulturist Anna excels at using the plants she cultivates to protect herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In battle, Anna uses her specially brewed fragrances to boost her allies' morale. Additionally, she employs her cultivated flowers to aid her allies. But if you think guarding against her flowers is enough, her beloved knight, Lubos, will make you pay a heavy price.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065190/extras/99bf4104054ffd5821e56d6eb4a475fa.avif?t=1759903706\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4065190?t=1759903706","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4065190?t=1759903706","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065190/25488eda9379792d77292e7ec93e51133b8d4ae3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759903706","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065190/25488eda9379792d77292e7ec93e51133b8d4ae3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759903706","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The expansion pack 2 of 'Esports Godfather' brings 5 new heroes with different styles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >#No need to restart the game; heroes can directly join the player's hero pool through training.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\u00b7Leon</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gladiator/Physical/Melee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065190/extras/3e0c1cfbf81871137cc89245a78d8cd8.avif?t=1759903706\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The slender specter Leon is obsessed with driving his enemies into madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In battle, Leon marks his enemies in various ways with eternal brands. Targets afflicted by his torment will descend into madness, attacking their own allies. When an enemy reaches their limit and is on the verge of collapse, Leon personally delivers a painful release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065190/extras/391c2916d406b7711042f82225ac0e62.avif?t=1759903706\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\u00b7Felicity</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support/Magic/Melee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065190/extras/5a7594dedb6090f788889745cd5473d5.avif?t=1759903706\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The harbinger of happiness, Felicity's mission is to bring 'happiness' to everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In combat, Felicity envelops her enemies in happiness with gentle yet irresistible force. Any attempt to resist this gift will incur her punishment\u2014she will drown their will in an overwhelming flood of happiness until they willingly succumb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065190/extras/28e8f15aeda741f515bf64b72bb33745.avif?t=1759903706\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\u00b7Fernan</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gladiator/Magic/Melee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065190/extras/a09d2bc98a62f3358555c2a2575bd658.avif?t=1759903706\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The memory thief Fernan delights in stealing others' most precious memories, adding them to his unique collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy who fights Fernan is shocked by his vast magical reserves. No one knows what magic Fernan specializes in, making it impossible to defend against.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;When your opponent casually casts the spell you've spent your life mastering and take pride in, anyone would despair.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065190/extras/07b5966075224c1527ec7ccf019353da.avif?t=1759903706\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\u00b7Chen Fengcheng</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warrior/Physical/Melee</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065190/extras/6b09458707daea58a0ff7f11127ceedd.avif?t=1759903706\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After years of relentless battles, the pirate lord Chen Fengcheng became the sole ruler of the kingdom's seas. He is renowned for his fair rewards and punishments when dividing spoils among his crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Everyone gets a share! Rewards are given regardless of merit or fault!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every crew member who receives a reward sings his praises, but those secretly eliminated before the division might disagree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065190/extras/cdb6616ca73434992d0b14b3d9d53182.avif?t=1759903706\" width=1560 height=878 /></span>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\u00b7Anna</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support/Magic/Ranged</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065190/extras/4a31be5715cba4130519a4ae9de03c4a.avif?t=1759903706\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a wealthy young lady who rarely leaves her chambers, the horticulturist Anna excels at using the plants she cultivates to protect herself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In battle, Anna uses her specially brewed fragrances to boost her allies' morale. Additionally, she employs her cultivated flowers to aid her allies. But if you think guarding against her flowers is enough, her beloved knight, Lubos, will make you pay a heavy price.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065190/extras/99bf4104054ffd5821e56d6eb4a475fa.avif?t=1759903706\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","developers":["Asteroid Game Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1278540","name":"Esports Godfather"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065190/dd197c97440d0bcbe5775441acdb32433952a74d/header.jpg?t=1759903706","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"The expansion pack 2 of 'Esports Godfather'","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"\u7535\u7ade\u6559\u7236\u6269\u5c55\u5305-2 - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$8.99</span> $8.09 USD","packageid":1425499,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-10% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":809}],"title":"Buy The expansion pack 2 of 'Esports Godfather'"}],"packages":[1425499],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":10,"final":809,"final_form